OL,3,GNEWSAClimbing centre approved despite
OL,4,Afunding setback
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction of a new city climbing
OL,7,Fwall and activity centre could begin
OL,8,Fnext year, after planners approved
OL,9,Frevised proposals for the project.
OL,11,FScaled-down plans for the facility at
OL,12,FFerry Meadows have been approved by
OL,13,FPeterborough City Council, although the
OL,14,Fproject still faces a funding
OL,15,Fshortfall.
OL,17,FNene Park Trust recently missed out on
OL,18,Fa #1m funding bid for the project,
OL,19,Fafter already scaling back the plans in
OL,20,Fan attempt to cut costs.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
